   "attributes": {
    "title": {
     "ja-ro": "Boushoku no Berserk: Ore dake Level to Iu Gainen o Toppa Suru"
    },
    "altTitles": [
     {
      "ja": "暴食のベルセルク～俺だけレベルという概念を突破する～ THE COMIC"
     },
     {
      "en": "Berserk of Gluttony: The One that Exceeds the Concept of Levels"
     },
     {
      "ko": "폭식의 베르세르크 ~나만 레벨이라는 개념을 돌파한다~"
     },
     {
      "zh": "狂怒的暴食 ～只有我突破了等级这概念～"
     },
     {
      "zh-hk": "狂怒的暴食 ～僅自己突破了等級這概念～"
     },
     {
      "fr": "Berserk de la Gourmandise : Celui qui surpasse le concept même de niveaux"
     }
    ],
    "description": {
     "en": "In this world, there are two types of people. Those Who have powerful \"skills\", and those who don't. People born with powerful skills, exterminate monsters to level up and become successful, while people without them, become failures, who are treated harshly by society. Follow the story of Fate, a guy who works as a gatekeeper, and whose only skill is gluttony, a skill that only makes him hungry.",
     "ja": "暴食《スキル》が真の姿を見せたとき、少年の運命が動き始める――\n\nスキルの優劣が絶対の世界で《暴食》という腹が減るだけのスキルを持って生まれた少年フェイト。無能と蔑まれ、危険で薄給な城の門番で日銭を稼ぐ最底辺の生活を強いられていたある日、城に侵入した賊を仕留めたことで《暴食》の真の能力、「殺した相手のスキル、能力を奪い取る」力が発動する――"
    },
